  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haiti Joint Response 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the urgent needs, World Vision (WV) and its partner Organisation des Coeurs pour le Changement des enfants Demunis d&apos;Haiti (OCCED&apos;H) are proposing an integrated response focusing on Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance (MPCA) and protection for 9,160 direct beneficiaries. This project is coordinated with Cordaid, Plan, Save the Children, and Tearfund. As active members of interagency clusters such as CCCM, CWG, and GBV, WV and OCCED&apos;H ensure a well-coordinated and comprehensive response to the humanitarian crisis in PAPMZ.</narrative>
  </description>
